    <string name="ctl_dist_scheduled">The upgrade to Debian %1$s starts in the next maintenance window (%2$s).</string>
    <string name="ctl_dist_start_text">A restore point is made first. The NAS then downloads and installs the new release and restarts; if a check fails afterwards, it goes back to the restore point. Start now, or in the next maintenance window.</string>
